CHAPTER.VERS:
And I, brothers, when I came to you

          {+}
        , did not come with excellency of speech or of wisdom, proclaiming to you

          {+}
         the testimony of God.

For I determined not to know anything among you

          {+}
        , except Jesus Christ, and him crucified.

And I was with you

          {+}
         in weakness, and in fear, and in much trembling.

that your

          {+}
         faith should not stand in the wisdom of men, but in the power of God.
